---
layout: base.njk
title: Events
bodyClass: events
summary: Upcoming Text + Pix gatherings in Durham, NC.
---
<header class="page-head">
  <h1>Events</h1>
  <p>Gatherings are free and open to anyone. Unless noted, we meet at the {{ site.venue.name }}, {{ site.venue.address }}.</p>
</header>

{% set coming = events | upcoming %}
<section class="event-list" aria-label="Upcoming events">
  <div data-event-list>
    {% for e in coming %}{% include "event.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="empty" data-empty {% if coming.length %}hidden{% endif %}>Nothing is scheduled right now. Join the mailing list and we'll tell you when the next date is set.</p>
</section>

<p class="more"><a href="/archive/">Past gatherings</a></p>
